# Astro static site

Inspired by awesome-cursorrules Astro guidance; adapted for plain CSS tokens (this repo does not use Tailwind).

## Structure

- Pages in `src/pages/` (file-based routing)
- Shared chrome in `src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro`
- Components in `src/components/`
- Content/config in `src/data/`
- Global styles: `src/styles/global.css` + `tokens.css`

## Components

- Prefer `.astro` over framework islands
- Pass data via props; keep copy in data modules
- Scoped `<style>` in components is fine; shared look lives in tokens/global
- Use `client:*` only when interactivity cannot be HTML/CSS/Tally embed

## Routing & URLs

- `trailingSlash: "always"` — never invent bare paths in hrefs
- Canonical + sitemap via `site` in `astro.config.mjs` and `pageUrl()`
- New indexable routes need sitemap priority in `astro.config.mjs` `PAGE_PRIORITY`

## Performance

- Static generation by default; no unnecessary runtime fetches
- Compress HTML is on; keep markup lean
- Images: prefer optimized static assets under `public/`; OG via `scripts/generate-og.mjs`

## SEO hooks

- Every page sets `PageMeta` into `BaseLayout`
- Structured data through `JsonLd` + builders in `structured-data.ts`
- OG: register slug in `generate-og.mjs` and `og-images.ts` when adding routes

## TypeScript

- Strict Astro tsconfig — avoid `any`
- Export typed records (`as const`) for copy/SEO data
- Keep helpers pure and colocated in `src/data/`

## Docs

- Astro: https://docs.astro.build
- Prefer official guides linked from `AGENTS.md` / Astro docs over inventing patterns
